Frequencies are in KHz. Enter 10 csv values for the wide band receiver. Enter only 5 values for the SI4732 receiver.
The first 5 frequencies correspond to buttons: Ground, Tower, Approach, Control, Clearance.
The second 5 frequencies are unlabeled buttons.
